//! This is the **shell**, not the tools. It decides admission and builds
//! answers; the app dispatches, because the app is the only party holding the
//! handles. That split is the same one [`crate::mcp::proto::validate`] makes, and it
//! keeps every rule here testable without a fleet.
//!
//! # The order of the three gates
//!
